UID:tribe-16162@jewelenvy.ca
DESCRIPTION:This is a 4 day intensive gem setting workshop. Day one is a p
 rep day where everyone will learn to finish their cast pieces and bring th
 em to a 600 emery finish in preparation for setting. This class has a mand
 atory kit that must be purchased from Jewel Envy. The kit includes 6 cast 
 pieces in sterling silver\, calibrated synthetic gemstones for the pieces\
 , the calibrated burs\, tool steel to make 2 specialized setting tools.
